			"notes": "Fabric port of Zombies Holograms-bug Fix for Minecraft 1.21.5 through 1.21.11.\n\n## Features\n\n- Excludes hologram armor stands from crosshair entity detection\n- Preserves entity interactions, block interactions, and item use\n- Provides a toggle key and an on-screen status indicator\n- Includes the Ignore Block Reactions and Disable Right Click Swinging options\n- Supports Cloth Config and optional Mod Menu integration\n- Runs entirely on the client without requiring server-side installation\n\n## Downloads\n\nChoose the JAR that matches your Minecraft version:\n\n- `ZombiesHologramsbugFix-Fabric-2.0.0+1.21.5.jar` for Minecraft 1.21.5\n- `ZombiesHologramsbugFix-Fabric-2.0.0+1.21.6-1.21.8.jar` for Minecraft 1.21.6–1.21.8\n- `ZombiesHologramsbugFix-Fabric-2.0.0+1.21.9-1.21.10.jar` for Minecraft 1.21.9–1.21.10\n- `ZombiesHologramsbugFix-Fabric-2.0.0+1.21.11.jar` for Minecraft 1.21.11\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Fabric Loader\n- Fabric API\n- Cloth Config API\n- Mod Menu (optional)"
